      "taskMessage": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> We now have a suspicious text, a support call, and a <b>cloned help desk</b> profile. Before we decide how to respond, document the impersonation using evidence the profile exposes publicly.\n\nFelix Rane wants to know what the campaign is worth. Imani Vale wants an immediate public warning. We will hear both positions after we establish what this account is.",
